{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.196.6.100","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80265,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c69b46d2e888d89eebb01b0ca4bf96ca","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"SSpartyof2\"] I don&#039;t have a TA to recommend to you, but if you poke around this site, you will definitely find some recommendations for ones in ON. Keep in mind, they really don&#039;t have to be local. Most\/all of your work with them will be done on the phone or via email. They can help you narrow down country\/resort\/pricing, etc. We went to Costa Rica for our honeymoon - not a lot of all-inclusives there, I don&#039;t think. Not that you have to do AI, but it can be easier in a lot of ways.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I also was married at Now Sapphire, near Cancun. It cost us about $2100 CAD per adult (double occupancy) from Vancouver. We booked in 2015 and the wedding was April 2016. Prices are usually a bit less from Toronto if that is your primary departure gate. Our day-of costs were about $6000 USD for 40 people. Don&#039;t forget exchange rates, taxes &amp;amp; gratuities (some mandatory\/built-in) when budgeting, because they really add up. Hope that helps a bit and good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915402,"PostDate":1471896758,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287586\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/287586-sspartyof2\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">SSpartyof2<\/span><\/a> I don't have a TA to recommend to you, but if you poke around this site, you will definitely find some recommendations for ones in ON. Keep in mind, they really don't have to be local. Most\/all of your work with them will be done on the phone or via email. They can help you narrow down country\/resort\/pricing, etc. We went to Costa Rica for our honeymoon - not a lot of all-inclusives there, I don't think. Not that you have to do AI, but it can be easier in a lot of ways.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I also was married at Now Sapphire, near Cancun. It cost us about $2100 CAD per adult (double occupancy) from Vancouver. We booked in 2015 and the wedding was April 2016. Prices are usually a bit less from Toronto if that is your primary departure gate. Our day-of costs were about $6000 USD for 40 people. Don't forget exchange rates, taxes & gratuities (some mandatory\/built-in) when budgeting, because they really add up. Hope that helps a bit and good luck!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>- Erin<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Now Sapphire review:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/5487-now-sapphire-riviera-cancun\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/5487-now-sapphire-riviera-cancun\/<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1417453045,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":11,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
