:"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0c79655d4f7023197a7b1a41c1724652","RawContent":"@[member=\"priscilla31185\"] unless they&#039;ve changed it very recently, I&#039;m not aware of any other approved photographers. We&#039;re going with Samuel Luna and are willing to pay the outside vendor fee to have him photograph our wedding. I love his photographic style and have heard great reviews about him.","Attachments":[],"Id":1899086,"PostDate":1435034138,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283516\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283516-priscilla31185\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">priscilla31185<\/span><\/a> unless they've changed it very recently, I'm not aware of any other approved photographers. We're going with Samuel Luna and are willing to pay the outside vendor fee to have him photograph our wedding. I love his photographic style and have heard great reviews about him.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"My planning thread: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/<\/a><br><br>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160123\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/44c5\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1410102185,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1454805895","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.66.102.249","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78894,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2b79626ef6001736c225560c336c10fe","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Great choice, Wafflesmom! We tell all our wedding couples that if photography is important to them at all, they&#039;ll be SO Much Happier!!! with the services of a professional photographer.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This is not a situation where there&#039;s a \"do-over\" option, so pretty important to get it right.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We&#039;ve created an album which compares the results of a resort photographer vs a professional - which you can see here: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152644932899487.1073741911.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Professional Photographer vs Resort photographer Album&lt;\/a&gt;: ....with a sample shown here.....&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/v\/t1.0-9\/10610675_10152644933054487_2680815615112427167_n.jpg?oh=832bb71e6885c41d064da42edc057a5a&amp;amp;oe=55F039FE\" alt=\"10610675_10152644933054487_2680815615112\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/10644738_10152644933309487_46653044229079535_o.jpg\" alt=\"10644738_10152644933309487_4665304422907\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We&#039;re not suggesting you need to choose us, there are many professional photographers in our area who would create an excellent photo record of your Special Day!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You can see some reviews of them at this link: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/c\/70-photographer-reviews\/&#039;&gt;Destination Wedding Photographer Reviews&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing everyone happy research, and all the best with their plans - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/10403956_10152644942329487_348322331340025725_o.jpg\" alt=\"10403956_10152644942329487_3483223313400\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899233,"PostDate":1435184626,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Great choice, Wafflesmom! We tell all our wedding couples that if photography is important to them at all, they'll be SO Much Happier!!! with the services of a professional photographer.<\/p>\n<p>This is not a situation where there's a \"do-over\" option, so pretty important to get it right.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We've created an album which compares the results of a resort photographer vs a professional - which you can see here: <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152644932899487.1073741911.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Professional Photographer vs Resort photographer Album<\/a>: ....with a sample shown here.....<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/v\/t1.0-9\/10610675_10152644933054487_2680815615112427167_n.jpg?oh=832bb71e6885c41d064da42edc057a5a&oe=55F039FE\" alt=\"10610675_10152644933054487_2680815615112\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/10644738_10152644933309487_46653044229079535_o.jpg\" alt=\"10644738_10152644933309487_4665304422907\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We're not suggesting you need to choose us, there are many professional photographers in our area who would create an excellent photo record of your Special Day!!!<\/p>\n<p>You can see some reviews of them at this link: <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/c\/70-photographer-reviews\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>Destination Wedding Photographer Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing everyone happy research, and all the best with their plans - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/10403956_10152644942329487_348322331340025725_o.jpg\" alt=\"10403956_10152644942329487_3483223313400\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i1378.photobucket.com\/albums\/ah106\/ContactIDoMexico\/MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\" alt=\"MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280214260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.149.98.29","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78894,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2bdad7877fcb43a41d7db8661b3bb7f6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@MissAmber26&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hi, How can we help you?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914369,"PostDate":1465854828,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@MissAmber26\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hi, How can we help you?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span>Saludos<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span><b>Virginia Hermosillo<\/b><\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Dream Art \u00a0Wedding Photography<\/b><\/p>\n<p><span><span>contact<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:vhermosillo@dreamartphotography.com'>@dreamartphotography.com<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span>Tel: +(52) 998 246-5657<\/span><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/weddings.dreamartphotography.com'>http:\/\/weddings.dreamartphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><img src=\"http:\/\/weddings.dreamartphotography.com\/images\/wedding-logo-moto.png\" alt=\"wedding-logo-moto.png\"><\/p>\n<p><span>\u00a0<\/span>","Email":"contact@dreamartphotography.com","IpAddress":"189.221.43.89","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1465498401,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287113.jpg?_r=1472626648","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"DreamArtPhotography","Id":287113,"Name":"DreamArtPhotography","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"12.130.117.120","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78894,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0357dda65e8dddd8b2fb95a3fdfbb558","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Encore is also an approved Palace vendor. We&#039;ve been working with Daniel and he&#039;s been fantastic! Very accommodating.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915304,"PostDate":1471295874,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Encore is also an approved Palace vendor. We've been working with Daniel and he's been fantastic! Very accommodating.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"slabadini@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.248.95.80","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1470696375,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287526.jpg?_r=1471031619","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sarahtystheknot","Id":287526,"Name":"sarahtystheknot","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":9,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
