> User Melanie5188 (287658)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.7.101.70","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75746,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cf49019b4c3b58369b4561f4a9f3fd5a","RawContent":"I was going back n forth with Dreams n Moon..... Dreams hotel rates were soooo much better....but their wedding collections they had none...I love the Collin pkgs at Moon...... Im still undecided......I have time tho.....\n[quote name=\"TeamArceo\" post=\"1836432\" timestamp=\"1393868458\"]\n[size=4]We have official choose Dreams Riviera Cancun as of today! I was contemplating back and forth for the longest time and I truly love the design and aesthetic of the resort and just everyone had an amazing time at Dreams. My first choice was Paradisus but it is way over budget and the closest resort to come to that is Dreams. The reason why I choose not to go to Moon Palace is because of the beach. My fiancee and I have been there and the beach is not the best. We were there in 2011 as we stayed an Cancun Palace now known as Hard Rock. I have guests that are coming to an all inclusive for the first time and if I were a guest at my wedding I would like to go to a decent beach. The beach is one of my top priorities.  The Palace resorts is definitely the best bang for your buck! If the perks is something that is really and truly important to you I would suggest to go with Palace. You get to free calls to the US\/Canada, $1500 resort credit and so on and so on. But the Palace resorts have now added %17 surcharge on the use of the resort credits since I have been there. I have been quoted for that resort and I don&#039;t want my guests to pay that extra $255 on top of their flight and accommodation. That is if they use all of the resort credits. My guests would be paying $2000++, I might as well have booked Paradisus. But the Palaces are still a great choice none the less. I ended up choosing Dreams because of all the great reviews here from the brides and I just really like how the resort looks. Unfortunately we just have to pay more to get our Dream wedding. I wish you the best and please do not hesitate to ask me any questions. Choosing the resort was the hardest part. [\/size]\n\nGood Luck !![\/quote]Did u think Dreams hotel rates was way better than Moon???  im thinking of my guests....","Attachments":[],"Id":1836460,"PostDate":1393879562,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I was going back n forth with Dreams n Moon..... Dreams hotel rates were soooo much better....but their wedding collections they had none...I love the Collin pkgs at Moon...... Im still undecided......I have time tho.....<\/p>\n<br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>TeamArceo, on 03 March 2014 - 10:40 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">We have official choose Dreams Riviera Cancun as of today! I was contemplating back and forth for the longest time and I truly love the design and aesthetic of the resort and just everyone had an amazing time at Dreams. My first choice was Paradisus but it is way over budget and the closest resort to come to that is Dreams. The reason why I choose not to go to Moon Palace is because of the beach. My fiancee and I have been there and the beach is not the best. We were there in 2011 as we stayed an Cancun Palace now known as Hard Rock. I have guests that are coming to an all inclusive for the first time and if I were a guest at my wedding I would like to go to a decent beach. The beach is one of my top priorities. \u00a0The Palace resorts is definitely the best bang for your buck! If the perks is something that is really and truly important to you I would suggest to go with Palace. You get to free calls to the US\/Canada, $1500 resort credit and so on and so on. But the Palace resorts have now added %17 surcharge on the use of the resort credits since I have been there. I have been quoted for that resort and I don't want my guests to pay that extra $255 on top of their flight and accommodation. That is if they use all of the resort credits. My guests would be paying $2000++, I might as well have booked Paradisus. But the Palaces are still a great choice none the less. I ended up choosing Dreams because of all the great reviews here from the brides and I just really like how the resort looks. Unfortunately we just have to pay more to get our Dream wedding. I wish you the best and please do not hesitate to ask me any questions. Choosing the resort was the hardest part.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good Luck !!\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Did u think Dreams hotel rates was way better than Moon???\u00a0 im thinking of my guests....<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"becca91970@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"129.112.109.41","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389101811,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beccafries","Id":275915,"Name":"beccafries","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.92.68.22","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75746,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4c32e00794e2d91e110ee0b5da7f296c","RawContent":"Congrats!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1836464,"PostDate":1393880224,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Congrats!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dfrey607@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"100.1.103.157","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1370098327,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270172.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wedding2014","Id":270172,"Name":"Wedding2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.146.105.139","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75746,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cf33d8919d50caab57e10845924795f9","RawContent":"[quote name=\"beccafries\" post=\"1836460\" timestamp=\"1393875962\"]\nI was going back n forth with Dreams n Moon..... Dreams hotel rates were soooo much better....but their wedding collections they had none...I love the Collin pkgs at Moon...... Im still undecided......I have time tho.....\n\nDid u think Dreams hotel rates was way better than Moon???  im thinking of my guests....[\/quote]From the quote I got from my TA it was more affordable for my guests. My wedding will be in June. July and August was completely out of budget for both resorts. \n[quote name=\"Wedding2014\" post=\"1836464\" timestamp=\"1393876624\"]\nCongrats!!![\/quote]Thank You! It&#039;s been a long process and it was just choosing the resort alone. :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1836465,"PostDate":1393880305,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>beccafries, on 03 March 2014 - 12:46 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I was going back n forth with Dreams n Moon..... Dreams hotel rates were soooo much better....but their wedding collections they had none...I love the Collin pkgs at Moon...... Im still undecided......I have time tho.....<\/p>\n<br><p>Did u think Dreams hotel rates was way better than Moon???\u00a0 im thinking of my guests....<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>From the quote I got from my TA it was more affordable for my guests. My wedding will be in June. July and August was completely out of budget for both resorts.\u00a0<\/p><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Wedding2014, on 03 March 2014 - 12:57 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Congrats!!!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Thank You! It's been a long process and it was just choosing the resort alone. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bev.john.arceo@gmail.com","IpAddress":"184.146.116.230","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1386128739,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275478.jpg?_r=1386742123","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TeamArceo","Id":275478,"Name":"TeamArceo","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"12.15.136.26","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75746,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4be516c936313ba636c7d849b9aecbd7","RawContent":"TeamArceo,\n\nDid you look at Dreams Tulum?  I only ask becuase the beaches are our priortiy too...and Dreams Tulum appears to ahve better beach than Dreams Riv.  We are torn between them and Playa Palace because of the beaches too.\n\nI am doing a site visit in August 2014.  So I will make my decision then.\n\nHave you site visited yet?\n\nKim","Attachments":[],"Id":1853938,"PostDate":1401916796,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                TeamArceo,\n\nDid you look at Dreams Tulum?  I only ask becuase the beaches are our priortiy too...and Dreams Tulum appears to ahve better beach than Dreams Riv.  We are torn between them and Playa Palace because of the beaches too.\n\nI am doing a site visit in August 2014.  So I will make my decision then.\n\nHave you site visited yet?\n\nKim\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kimmykillelea@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"12.15.136.26","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1401913078,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278247.jpg?_r=1471992740","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"fluffykim","Id":278247,"Name":"fluffykim","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.160.51.243","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75746,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"43e83edcdfb6fe66f1a1d44c2d8ec493","RawContent":"[quote name=\"fluffykim\" post=\"1853938\" timestamp=\"1401913196\"]\nTeamArceo, Did you look at Dreams Tulum? I only ask becuase the beaches are our priortiy too...and Dreams Tulum appears to ahve better beach than Dreams Riv. We are torn between them and Playa Palace because of the beaches too. I am doing a site visit in August 2014. So I will make my decision then. Have you site visited yet? Kim[\/quote]@[member=\"fluffykim\"] Did you have your wedding already? If so which Resort did you end up going with?? I have been looking for early 2017 and I&#039;m between Dreams Tulum and Playacar Palace. I know you get more perks with PP for the actual wedding but I also want to make sure that my guests are getting a good deal too! Any help would be greatly appreciated!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1914957,"PostDate":1469081117,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>fluffykim, on 04 June 2014 - 01:19 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>TeamArceo, Did you look at Dreams Tulum? I only ask becuase the beaches are our priortiy too...and Dreams Tulum appears to ahve better beach than Dreams Riv. We are torn between them and Playa Palace because of the beaches too. I am doing a site visit in August 2014. So I will make my decision then. Have you site visited yet? Kim<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278247\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278247-fluffykim\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">fluffykim<\/span><\/a> Did you have your wedding already? If so which Resort did you end up going with?? I have been looking for early 2017 and I'm between Dreams Tulum and Playacar Palace. I know you get more perks with PP for the actual wedding but I also want to make sure that my guests are getting a good deal too! Any help would be greatly appreciated!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarah.heben@modmed.com","IpAddress":"24.160.50.2","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1457635590,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"heben42","Id":286454,"Name":"heben42","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.46.28","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75746,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bfbeecad02a839fb5f77718043b3ace9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community, heben42 and Congrats on your upcoming dw next year! Our magnificent Mayan Riviera has so many wonderful wedding venues, whichever one you end up choosing will be amazing! So big exhale....it&#039;s going to be Amazing!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;To help you see what each of your choices would look like as photo backdrops, here are some magical wedding moments that matter we captured at each one.....enjoy!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;From the &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!Dreams-Tulum-Wedding-photographer-paradise\/k7mfu\/56ae19670cf2b4e0b61019a5&#039;&gt;Dream Tulum Wedding Story Album:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_614daf1dbb5d45e98d498f68ddf06153.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_614daf1dbb5d45e98d498f68ddf06153.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_614daf1dbb5d45e98d498f68ddf06153.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;From the &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!Playacar-Palace-Wedding-Jennifer-Iain\/k7mfu\/56b0bf880cf2062bd4142222&#039;&gt;Playacar Palace Wedding Story Album: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_3aae218f87d94c32b8e05e921a173955.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_3aae218f87d94c32b8e05e921a173955.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_3aae218f87d94c32b8e05e921a173955.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans ~ cheers!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Moments That Matter Photography team :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914962,"PostDate":1469126751,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community, heben42 and Congrats on your upcoming dw next year! Our magnificent Mayan Riviera has so many wonderful wedding venues, whichever one you end up choosing will be amazing! So big exhale....it's going to be Amazing!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>To help you see what each of your choices would look like as photo backdrops, here are some magical wedding moments that matter we captured at each one.....enjoy!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>From the <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!Dreams-Tulum-Wedding-photographer-paradise\/k7mfu\/56ae19670cf2b4e0b61019a5' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Dream Tulum Wedding Story Album:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_614daf1dbb5d45e98d498f68ddf06153.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_614daf1dbb5d45e98d498f68ddf06153.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_614daf1dbb5d45e98d498f68ddf06153.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>From the <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!Playacar-Palace-Wedding-Jennifer-Iain\/k7mfu\/56b0bf880cf2062bd4142222' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Playacar Palace Wedding Story Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_3aae218f87d94c32b8e05e921a173955.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_3aae218f87d94c32b8e05e921a173955.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_3aae218f87d94c32b8e05e921a173955.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans ~ cheers!!!<\/p>\n<p>Moments That Matter Photography team <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i1378.photobucket.com\/albums\/ah106\/ContactIDoMexico\/MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\" alt=\"MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280214260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"12.15.136.26","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75746,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5b2fc196cdb1d3dc07a28eb628789c66","RawContent":"[quote name=\"heben42\" post=\"1914957\" timestamp=\"1469077517\"]\n@[member=\"fluffykim\"] Did you have your wedding already? If so which Resort did you end up going with?? I have been looking for early 2017 and I&#039;m between Dreams Tulum and Playacar Palace. I know you get more perks with PP for the actual wedding but I also want to make sure that my guests are getting a good deal too! Any help would be greatly appreciated!![\/quote]yes...we got married at Dreams and it was AMAZING\n\nwe had great perks.  We got free upgrade room and my stay was free due to the amount of rooms we booked.  \n\namazing wedding","Attachments":[],"Id":1915158,"PostDate":1470331969,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>heben42, on 20 July 2016 - 10:05 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278247\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278247-fluffykim\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">fluffykim<\/span><\/a> Did you have your wedding already? If so which Resort did you end up going with?? I have been looking for early 2017 and I'm between Dreams Tulum and Playacar Palace. I know you get more perks with PP for the actual wedding but I also want to make sure that my guests are getting a good deal too! Any help would be greatly appreciated!!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>yes...we got married at Dreams and it was AMAZING<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>we had great perks. \u00a0We got free upgrade room and my stay was free due to the amount of rooms we booked. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>amazing wedding<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kimmykillelea@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"12.15.136.26","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1401913078,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278247.jpg?_r=1471992740","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"fluffykim","Id":278247,"Name":"fluffykim","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":17,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
