> Time: 1472629820 / Wed, 31 Aug 2016 07:50:20 +0000
> URL: /index.php?/REST/Forums/topic/getPosts?topicId=80055&start=20&SessionId=e7195d3f590cfa111eaf2c95df58ecdf
> User Melanie5188 (287658)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.216.199.166","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80055,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"95adc6ebd7e43b3371a5498b818893f0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey everyone!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Our ceremony date and venue is booked for Nov 11, 2017 at Grand Sunset Princess. We&#039;re working with a TA and got a room block booked and deposits are due in 2 weeks. I&#039;m waiting to see how many guests we have before we book our reception (a lot of guests are not willing to commit this far in advance)&amp;nbsp; :wacko:&amp;nbsp;Wedding website is up and running. I&#039;m still in the process of convincing the FH that we need a photographer and\/or videographer, so that&#039;s still up for review.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So glad to have found this forum!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914677,"PostDate":1467737222,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey everyone!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Our ceremony date and venue is booked for Nov 11, 2017 at Grand Sunset Princess. We're working with a TA and got a room block booked and deposits are due in 2 weeks. I'm waiting to see how many guests we have before we book our reception (a lot of guests are not willing to commit this far in advance)\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wacko.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wacko:' \/>\u00a0Wedding website is up and running. I'm still in the process of convincing the FH that we need a photographer and\/or videographer, so that's still up for review.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So glad to have found this forum!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nylammeg@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.245.138.25","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1461171370,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286774.jpg?_r=1467731972","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"gaichan","Id":286774,"Name":"gaichan","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.79.196","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80055,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6e43b75e1793f57bec918bf173214667","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Mangosong\" post=\"1914653\" timestamp=\"1467679031\"]\n@[member=\"Hola20162\"] We went with weddingwire.com so far it&#039;s been great for what we need. But a bunch of my friends went with mywedding.com it seems it&#039;s more customizable?[\/quote]I used weddingwire.com as well and love it! It was super easy to use and the ability to create guest lists and track your RSVPs, meal selections and even create a seating plan is awesome. No complaints so far. It will surely be a life saver!\n[quote name=\"gaichan\" post=\"1914677\" timestamp=\"1467733622\"]\nHey everyone! \n \nOur ceremony date and venue is booked for Nov 11, 2017 at Grand Sunset Princess. We&#039;re working with a TA and got a room block booked and deposits are due in 2 weeks. I&#039;m waiting to see how many guests we have before we book our reception (a lot of guests are not willing to commit this far in advance)  :wacko: Wedding website is up and running. I&#039;m still in the process of convincing the FH that we need a photographer and\/or videographer, so that&#039;s still up for review.\n \nSo glad to have found this forum![\/quote]The photographer was my hardest decision so far. It&#039;s SO expensive but I figure at the end of the day, the photos are what you will have to look at decades later after some of the memories have faded. It took a little convincing as my FI had sticker shock but at the end of the day, he just wants me to be happy. And after I showed him examples of the photographer&#039;s work, he was blown away that they were \"art\" and not just the cheesy posed photos of yester year. It is definitely one of the harder (and more expensive!) decisions to make.  Good luck!","Attachments":[],"Id":1914680,"PostDate":1467739435,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Mangosong, on 04 July 2016 - 05:37 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287215\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/287215-hola20162\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Hola20162<\/span><\/a> We went with weddingwire.com so far it's been great for what we need. But a bunch of my friends went with mywedding.com it seems it's more customizable?<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI used weddingwire.com as well and love it! It was super easy to use and the ability to create guest lists and track your RSVPs, meal selections and even create a seating plan is awesome. No complaints so far. It will surely be a life saver!<br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>gaichan, on 05 July 2016 - 08:47 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Hey everyone!\u00a0<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nOur ceremony date and venue is booked for Nov 11, 2017 at Grand Sunset Princess. We're working with a TA and got a room block booked and deposits are due in 2 weeks. I'm waiting to see how many guests we have before we book our reception (a lot of guests are not willing to commit this far in advance)\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wacko.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wacko:' \/>\u00a0Wedding website is up and running. I'm still in the process of convincing the FH that we need a photographer and\/or videographer, so that's still up for review.<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nSo glad to have found this forum!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThe photographer was my hardest decision so far. It's SO expensive but I figure at the end of the day, the photos are what you will have to look at decades later after some of the memories have faded. It took a little convincing as my FI had sticker shock but at the end of the day, he just wants me to be happy. And after I showed him examples of the photographer's work, he was blown away that they were \"art\" and not just the cheesy posed photos of yester year. It is definitely one of the harder (and more expensive!) decisions to make.  Good luck!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lperrier@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"76.65.225.116","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1431532421,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283084.jpg?_r=1469546129","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LeanneP","Id":283084,"Name":"LeanneP","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"104.129.204.76","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80055,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"964d8711bfcdb31105432074401ebf4e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello everyone! I&#039;m getting married September 2, 2017 in Negril Jamaica. We originally were planning on a Sandals Weddingmoon, but since my fianc\u00e9&#039;s family is Jamaican, we decided to go with a smaller hotel and have more of a casual real Jamaican vibe. We&#039;re on a budget and most of our guest are too.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We&#039;re currently trying to choose between the beach and the cliffs. Negril Tree House on the beach and Negril Escape on the cliffs. Both look wonderful and have excellent reviews.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If anyone can give any advice as to photographers and DJ&#039;s I&#039;d really appreciate it. I&#039;m a HUGE Reggae music fan. The music is more important to me than almost anything!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915423,"PostDate":1472058308,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello everyone! I'm getting married September 2, 2017 in Negril Jamaica. We originally were planning on a Sandals Weddingmoon, but since my fianc\u00e9's family is Jamaican, we decided to go with a smaller hotel and have more of a casual real Jamaican vibe. We're on a budget and most of our guest are too.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We're currently trying to choose between the beach and the cliffs. Negril Tree House on the beach and Negril Escape on the cliffs. Both look wonderful and have excellent reviews.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If anyone can give any advice as to photographers and DJ's I'd really appreciate it. I'm a HUGE Reggae music fan. The music is more important to me than almost anything!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"suse72467@gmail.com","IpAddress":"104.129.204.109","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1471530557,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Suse72467","Id":287582,"Name":"Suse72467","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"103.69.92.64","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80055,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"548a7c807340b750ba8911f107f052c9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;My wedding is in December at Leonard&#039;s Palazzo in NY. Me and my fiancee are &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.leonardspalazzo.com\/service\/wedding-hall-services\/&#039;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;planning a long island wedding&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/a&gt; as they are comletely affordable and matches our wedding vision. We are all set,&amp;nbsp; just waiting to get into our dresses and reach the venue to tie a wedding knot.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915457,"PostDate":1472199782,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>My wedding is in December at Leonard's Palazzo in NY. Me and my fiancee are <a href='http:\/\/www.leonardspalazzo.com\/service\/wedding-hall-services\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><strong>planning a long island wedding<\/strong><\/a> as they are comletely affordable and matches our wedding vision. We are all set,\u00a0 just waiting to get into our dresses and reach the venue to tie a wedding knot.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vanessahodge26@gmail.com","IpAddress":"117.247.211.216","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1465811553,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Venessa26","Id":287136,"Name":"Venessa26","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.254.20.26","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80055,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1472422094,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"03aaf953435b96945457cef814347c2b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Everyone!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My fianc\u00e9 and I are getting married on August 4, 2017 at Now Larimar in Punta Cana. I know everyone says the time will fly but we are just so excited for it to finally get here! We are currently trying to decide on a photographer and decide on bridesmaid dresses. I always thought I had an idea of what I wanted but now that I&#039;m looking I love so many different ideas and styles! This planning is definitely not easy! Best wishes to you all during your planning!&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Aparke10\"] Hey girl! Just read your post and you are going to LOVE Majestic Elegance!! My best friend got married there and my sister got married next door at Colonial. The resort is gorgeous and the perfect size for a wedding! It honestly has everything you and your guests will need and more! You made a great choice! Let me know if you have any questions as I would love to answer them for you.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Heather (huge fan of the Majestic resorts!!)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915473,"PostDate":1472422011,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Everyone!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My fianc\u00e9 and I are getting married on August 4, 2017 at Now Larimar in Punta Cana. I know everyone says the time will fly but we are just so excited for it to finally get here! We are currently trying to decide on a photographer and decide on bridesmaid dresses. I always thought I had an idea of what I wanted but now that I'm looking I love so many different ideas and styles! This planning is definitely not easy! Best wishes to you all during your planning!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<br><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286351\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286351-aparke10\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Aparke10<\/span><\/a> Hey girl! Just read your post and you are going to LOVE Majestic Elegance!! My best friend got married there and my sister got married next door at Colonial. The resort is gorgeous and the perfect size for a wedding! It honestly has everything you and your guests will need and more! You made a great choice! Let me know if you have any questions as I would love to answer them for you.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Heather (huge fan of the Majestic resorts!!)<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"heather_d26@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.254.20.26","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1471733549,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287595.jpg?_r=1471732058","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"heatherd26","Id":287595,"Name":"heatherd26","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.123.7.202","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80055,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d436f99edfbca3fc086ad3a956515f02","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We will be getting married May 19th 2017 at Grand Sunset Princess in Mexico !!! &amp;nbsp;We moved quite quickly after getting engaged and decided on the resort, sent out invitations and made our wedding website with 6 weeks of getting engaged.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Our deposits were due mid-July and we currently have approximately 65 guests booked in .. there are a few stragglers that may decide to book last minute.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So far we haven&#039;t done too much planning with our co-ordinator at the resort, but we have picked our ceremony location and time as well the reception area. We have also booked an external photographer! Less than 9 months to go.. I feel like I have so much left to do, but sometimes don&#039;t know where to start!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy planning everyone &amp;nbsp;:)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"gaichan\"] We chose the same resort :) It looks beautiful and all the wedding reviews sound amazing! There is a Facebook group that has past and present brides posting questions, photos, reviews of services, etc. I have found it very helpful so far!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/59537241435\/&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/59537241435\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\n&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915491,"PostDate":1472496304,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We will be getting married May 19th 2017 at Grand Sunset Princess in Mexico !!! \u00a0We moved quite quickly after getting engaged and decided on the resort, sent out invitations and made our wedding website with 6 weeks of getting engaged.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Our deposits were due mid-July and we currently have approximately 65 guests booked in .. there are a few stragglers that may decide to book last minute.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So far we haven't done too much planning with our co-ordinator at the resort, but we have picked our ceremony location and time as well the reception area. We have also booked an external photographer! Less than 9 months to go.. I feel like I have so much left to do, but sometimes don't know where to start!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy planning everyone \u00a0<img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286774\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286774-gaichan\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gaichan<\/span><\/a> We chose the same resort <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> It looks beautiful and all the wedding reviews sound amazing! There is a Facebook group that has past and present brides posting questions, photos, reviews of services, etc. I have found it very helpful so far!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/59537241435\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.facebook...ps\/59537241435\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cadeau.samantha@gmail.com","IpAddress":"216.123.7.202","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1461181493,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286776.jpg?_r=1461191272","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"scadeau","Id":286776,"Name":"scadeau","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":26,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
