p=\"name\">colleentf09<\/span><\/a> My contract was 5 pages long and the part about the outside vendor fees was under the fifth section of the contract entitled, \"Additional Costs\". This is where costs for things like private receptions and cocktail hours are outlined. Do you have this info? I hope this helps<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThanks! I looked at my contact again and remembered seeing this. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"colleentf09@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"68.48.23.35","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1414429914,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280885.jpg?_r=1414462566","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"colleentf09","Id":280885,"Name":"colleentf09","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.149.55.219","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78216,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"03b45cd415a258d3836519ba955a3600","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello Ladies,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Definitely you can have a lot of great spots for video @Moon Palace, take a look at this Hindu wedding, it was full of great moments.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;https:\/\/vimeo.com\/102847216&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1877776,"PostDate":1415216220,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello Ladies,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Definitely you can have a lot of great spots for video @Moon Palace, take a look at this Hindu wedding, it was full of great moments.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><iframe src=\"https:\/\/player.vimeo.com\/video\/102847216\" class=\"EmbeddedVideo\" width=\"400\" height=\"250\" frameborder=\"0\"><\/iframe><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mike@cancunweddingvideo.com","IpAddress":"189.149.44.30","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1198794664,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208060.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mikecantarell","Id":208060,"Name":"Mikecantarell","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.159.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78216,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"39a568f6ce676a1e070360acd3a2c1fa","RawContent":"For anyone interested in custom totes for Out of town bags\/giveaways, Wedding Chicks is have an early black Friday special, 50% off! Promo code is EARLYBIRD. It&#039;s valid till this Sunday, November 9. Happy shopping :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1877962,"PostDate":1415412927,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                For anyone interested in custom totes for Out of town bags\/giveaways, Wedding Chicks is have an early black Friday special, 50% off! Promo code is EARLYBIRD. It's valid till this Sunday, November 9. Happy shopping <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"My planning thread: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/<\/a><br><br>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160123\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/44c5\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1410102185,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1454805895","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"92.27.114.91","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78216,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"babef942c04ba338f20cd4d1040ce1f8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi All&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am getting married at Moon Palace on the 21st May 2015, received all our paperwork to fill in last week from our off site wedding coordinator Valeria who is really quick answering any of my questions.&amp;nbsp; We was told 400usd for an outside photographer.&amp;nbsp; What colours are you all having as I still cannot decide. xx&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1878234,"PostDate":1415803701,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi All<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am getting married at Moon Palace on the 21st May 2015, received all our paperwork to fill in last week from our off site wedding coordinator Valeria who is really quick answering any of my questions.\u00a0 We was told 400usd for an outside photographer.\u00a0 What colours are you all having as I still cannot decide. xx<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"zoe@gands.co.uk","IpAddress":"92.27.114.91","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1412682348,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"zoeherr","Id":280335,"Name":"zoeherr","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.159.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78216,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4ba0d6ca00a32227e32d741631929e26","RawContent":"[quote name=\"zoeherr\" post=\"1878234\" timestamp=\"1415800101\"]\nHi All\n \nI am getting married at Moon Palace on the 21st May 2015, received all our paperwork to fill in last week from our off site wedding coordinator Valeria who is really quick answering any of my questions.  We was told 400usd for an outside photographer.  What colours are you all having as I still cannot decide. xx[\/quote]Hi @[member=\"zoeherr\"]! Congrats on your upcoming nuptial \u263a\ufe0f My offsite coordinator is Elizabeth and she&#039;s been great to deal with too. Our colours are grey and coral.","Attachments":[],"Id":1878283,"PostDate":1415854548,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>zoeherr, on 12 November 2014 - 06:48 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Hi All<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nI am getting married at Moon Palace on the 21st May 2015, received all our paperwork to fill in last week from our off site wedding coordinator Valeria who is really quick answering any of my questions.\u00a0 We was told 400usd for an outside photographer.\u00a0 What colours are you all having as I still cannot decide. xx<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nHi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"280335\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/280335-zoeherr\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">zoeherr<\/span><\/a>! Congrats on your upcoming nuptial \u263a\ufe0f My offsite coordinator is Elizabeth and she's been great to deal with too. Our colours are grey and coral.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"My planning thread: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/<\/a><br><br>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160123\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/44c5\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1410102185,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1454805895","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"92.27.114.91","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78216,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"be331a1e9b41e61926e962e899fd8f85","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Wafflesmom\" post=\"1878283\" timestamp=\"1415850948\"]\nHi @[member=\"zoeherr\"]! Congrats on your upcoming nuptial \u263a\ufe0f My offsite coordinator is Elizabeth and she&#039;s been great to deal with too. Our colours are grey and coral.[\/quote]Wow you are really organised, I was thinking coral but really like baby pink but not sure if it will look washed out when having pictures done on the beach.  have you choosen a photographer as yet?","Attachments":[],"Id":1878297,"PostDate":1415884533,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Wafflesmom, on 12 November 2014 - 08:55 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"280335\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/280335-zoeherr\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">zoeherr<\/span><\/a>! Congrats on your upcoming nuptial \u263a\ufe0f My offsite coordinator is Elizabeth and she's been great to deal with too. Our colours are grey and coral.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Wow you are really organised, I was thinking coral but really like baby pink but not sure if it will look washed out when having pictures done on the beach.\u00a0 have you choosen a photographer as yet?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"zoe@gands.co.uk","IpAddress":"92.27.114.91","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1412682348,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"zoeherr","Id":280335,"Name":"zoeherr","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.172.119.145","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78216,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"216a41ffbf23b6ad02bdc0cef33ddf51","RawContent":"My colors are navy and gold with pink. I originally wanted navy bridesmaid dresses but then I thought navy would be too harsh for beach pictures. So I&#039;m going with ivory dresses, nude shoes, shades of pink flowers with a navy ribbon. I found gold earrings with a bkush and navy stone in hm. I&#039;ll be getting it for them","Attachments":[],"Id":1878299,"PostDate":1415885145,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                My colors are navy and gold with pink. I originally wanted navy bridesmaid dresses but then I thought navy would be too harsh for beach pictures. So I'm going with ivory dresses, nude shoes, shades of pink flowers with a navy ribbon. I found gold earrings with a bkush and navy stone in hm. I'll be getting it for them \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>So far 79 adult guests + bride and groom + 13 kids = 164 room nights. Focused on planning without stressing.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10716;116\/st\/20160617\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/7257\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"bush.chanel@gmail.com","IpAddress":"170.115.248.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401306470,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"TheBHolders","Id":278146,"Name":"TheBHolders","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.42.38","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78216,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"28baea09d80bb63fd4a49cc09f62c3b2","RawContent":"[quote name=\"zoeherr\" post=\"1878297\" timestamp=\"1415880933\"]\nWow you are really organised, I was thinking coral but really like baby pink but not sure if it will look washed out when having pictures done on the beach.  have you choosen a photographer as yet?[\/quote]@[member=\"zoeherr\"] thanks for the compliment :) I think I&#039;m addicted to wedding planning, and I still have over a year to go lol. Baby pink will look beautiful! You can always compliment it with another color like gold, gray, silver, there&#039;s lots of options! And we have chosen and booked Samuel Luna. Check him out, his photos are fabulous and he&#039;s really great at getting back to me with any concerns or questions I have. Have you chosen your photographer?\n[quote name=\"TheBHolders\" post=\"1878299\" timestamp=\"1415881545\"]\nMy colors are navy and gold with pink. I originally wanted navy bridesmaid dresses but then I thought navy would be too harsh for beach pictures. So I&#039;m going with ivory dresses, nude shoes, shades of pink flowers with a navy ribbon. I found gold earrings with a bkush and navy stone in hm. I&#039;ll be getting it for them[\/quote]Those colors sound really good. I considered navy with coral but my fianc\u00e9 wanted gray. I figured I should give him his choice of color since I&#039;m deciding on the rest of the decor lol\n\nIvory dresses with the earrings will look great!","Attachments":[],"Id":1878315,"PostDate":1415903402,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>zoeherr, on 13 November 2014 - 05:15 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Wow you are really organised, I was thinking coral but really like baby pink but not sure if it will look washed out when having pictures done on the beach.\u00a0 have you choosen a photographer as yet?<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\n@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"280335\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/280335-zoeherr\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">zoeherr<\/span><\/a> thanks for the compliment <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I think I'm addicted to wedding planning, and I still have over a year to go lol. Baby pink will look beautiful! You can always compliment it with another color like gold, gray, silver, there's lots of options! And we have chosen and booked Samuel Luna. Check him out, his photos are fabulous and he's really great at getting back to me with any concerns or questions I have. Have you chosen your photographer?<br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>TheBHolders, on 13 November 2014 - 05:25 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>My colors are navy and gold with pink. I originally wanted navy bridesmaid dresses but then I thought navy would be too harsh for beach pictures. So I'm going with ivory dresses, nude shoes, shades of pink flowers with a navy ribbon. I found gold earrings with a bkush and navy stone in hm. I'll be getting it for them<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThose colors sound really good. I considered navy with coral but my fianc\u00e9 wanted gray. I figured I should give him his choice of color since I'm deciding on the rest of the decor lol<br><br>\nIvory dresses with the earrings will look great! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"My planning thread: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/<\/a><br><br>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160123\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/44c5\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1410102185,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1454805895","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":120,"TotalPages":12,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":110},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
