att.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\">\u00a0rating on <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/jasminandmatt\/reviews'>Facebook<\/a> & <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21784-jasmin-matt-photography\/'>BestDestinationWedding.com<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Still not convinced? Read our <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/info\/testimonials\/'>testimonials of appreciation from previous couples <3<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>Website:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/'>http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Email:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:info@jasminandmatt.com'>info@jasminandmatt.com<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Phone:<\/strong>\u00a0<a><span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\">+52-1-984-114-3386<\/span><\/a><br><strong>Facebook:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/jasminandmatt\/'>Jasmin & Matt Photography<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Instagram:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/jasminandmattphotography\/'>@jasminandmattphotography<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Pinterest:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/jasminandmatt'>Jasmin & Matt<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Ask us how we can help you plan your perfect wedding day.<\/span><\/span>","Email":"forward@jasminandmatt.com","IpAddress":"187.153.21.84","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1464799539,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287055.jpg?_r=1464796174","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JasminMattPhoto","Id":287055,"Name":"JasminMattPhoto","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.46.28","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80239,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"71d877cb0e21fa4b61fc67a2eb67cf48","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the boards mrsjohnson2017 and Congrats on your upcoming May wedding next year!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You&#039;re right about our magnificent Mayan Riviera presenting some challenges for wedding hair and make-up ~ with our tropical heat and ocean breezes! There are many local artistis who know how to deal with our local conditions and will have you looking your very BEST all day long, from first look to last dance, in all the photos you cherish forever !&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;An outstanding artist in this field is &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.vo-evolution.com&#039;&gt;VoEvolution Wedding Hair &amp;amp; Make-up&lt;\/a&gt; ! Here&#039;s Natacha and her team of talented artists ....enjoy!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/idomexico.com\/wedding-forum\/attachments\/vo-evolution-7-jpg.351\/\" alt=\"vo-evolution-7-jpg.351\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....and here&#039;s one example of their artwork:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.vo-evolution.com\/images\/galeries\/photoshoot\/022_HD_studiobytheferry.JPG\" alt=\"022_HD_studiobytheferry.JPG\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! Moments That Matter Photography team :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915237,"PostDate":1470770867,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to the boards mrsjohnson2017 and Congrats on your upcoming May wedding next year!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You're right about our magnificent Mayan Riviera presenting some challenges for wedding hair and make-up ~ with our tropical heat and ocean breezes! There are many local artistis who know how to deal with our local conditions and will have you looking your very BEST all day long, from first look to last dance, in all the photos you cherish forever !<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>An outstanding artist in this field is <a href='http:\/\/www.vo-evolution.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>VoEvolution Wedding Hair & Make-up<\/a> ! Here's Natacha and her team of talented artists ....enjoy!!!<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/idomexico.com\/wedding-forum\/attachments\/vo-evolution-7-jpg.351\/\" alt=\"vo-evolution-7-jpg.351\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....and here's one example of their artwork:<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.vo-evolution.com\/images\/galeries\/photoshoot\/022_HD_studiobytheferry.JPG\" alt=\"022_HD_studiobytheferry.JPG\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! Moments That Matter Photography team <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i1378.photobucket.com\/albums\/ah106\/ContactIDoMexico\/MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\" alt=\"MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280214260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.149.172.63","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80239,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e7d8a7376f28c114bf5b7d2dc533ec75","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"mrsjohnson2017\"] A lot of our African brides have worked with Styling trio. The best thing is to requests from them pictures of their work they have done on african american brides. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;A little tip, I am assuming you have your weave already ready to be styles. and some pictures on what you have envisioned.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy Planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915241,"PostDate":1470774780,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287531\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/287531-mrsjohnson2017\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">mrsjohnson2017<\/span><\/a> A lot of our African brides have worked with Styling trio. The best thing is to requests from them pictures of their work they have done on african american brides. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>A little tip, I am assuming you have your weave already ready to be styles. and some pictures on what you have envisioned.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection! Supporting you brides and help you feel less overwhelmed during the wedding planning process.<\/p>\n<p>Have fun the best is yet to come!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is where I will be posting all videos about most common question about Destination wedding<\/p>\n<p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html\">http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326857987,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.67.9.47","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80239,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eb62c35ef553ed64a37429b0cf21f704","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Look into Styling Trio whose studio is based in Playa del Carmen, but their stylist will also travel to you! They specialize in women of all colors and ethnicities and are considered the best in the area and are also active on the BDW site, helping brides with hair\/makeup questions!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.stylingtrio.com&#039;&gt;www.stylingtrio.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915247,"PostDate":1470785271,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Look into Styling Trio whose studio is based in Playa del Carmen, but their stylist will also travel to you! They specialize in women of all colors and ethnicities and are considered the best in the area and are also active on the BDW site, helping brides with hair\/makeup questions!!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.stylingtrio.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>www.stylingtrio.com<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia;\"><strong>MARIESAM SANCHEZ PHOTOGRAPHY<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br>\nWEBSITE: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchez.com\">www.mariesamsanchez.com<\/a><br>\nBLOG: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchezblog.com\">www.mariesamsanchez.com<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchez.com\/blog'>\/blog<\/a><br>\nCONTACT ME: <a  class=\"bbc_email\" href=\"mailto:mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com?subject=BDW%20Inquiry\" title=\"E-mail Link\">mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com<\/a><br><br><img src=\"http:\/\/i287.photobucket.com\/albums\/ll150\/msam007562\/063cb5c8-dbda-4822-87fe-ba3c0ebcdb7f.jpg\" alt=\"063cb5c8-dbda-4822-87fe-ba3c0ebcdb7f.jpg\">","Email":"mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.100.61.37","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1285957945,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232833.jpg?_r=1422091823","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":220,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MarieSamSanchezPhoto","Id":232833,"Name":"MarieSamSanchezPhoto","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.239.253.193","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80239,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Johnsonspartyof2, 09 August 2016 - 06:38 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1470796684,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f3cfd4251c6e9b53fbab4a0f6b5350dd","RawContent":"I Am Also In Search Of One For My Wedding Day And So Far The Two I Am Considering Is Styling Trio And Melissa V From MVP Hair And Makeup","Attachments":[],"Id":1915251,"PostDate":1470796645,"PostContent":"  