=\"mrsjohnson2017\"]! And congratulations on your upcoming wedding in Playa! Also thank you to all who have replied here on this thread recommending us. :)&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp; We here at Styling Trio&lt;\/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;Riviera Maya are very flattered.&amp;nbsp; :wub:&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;that you trust and admire our work.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);font-size:12.8px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);font-size:12.8px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;@[member=\"mrsjohnson2017\"]....Styling Trio&#039;s been working in the Riviera Maya (Cancun, Playa del Carmen and Tulum areas) for&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;Helvetica Neue&#039;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;8+ years and our artists have experience with different types of skin and skin tones. I&#039;m attaching some photos so you can see so&lt;span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"&gt;me of o&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"&gt;ur work also here is our link in the Newbies forum:&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/80080-were-styling-trio-riviera-maya\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/80080-were-styling-trio-riviera-maya\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);font-size:12.8px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:&#039;Helvetica Neue&#039;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"&gt;If interested in g