> User jacquewedding (283943)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":3,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":31,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1915494,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":287595,"Name":"heatherd26","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287595.jpg?_r=1471732058","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1472492166,"LastPoster":{"Id":284728,"Name":"OttawaBride2017","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284728.jpg?_r=1448387511","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":33,"Preview":{"Id":1915494,"PostDate":1472492166,"PostContent":"Hi Everyone! \u00a0 I am really struggling to find bridesmaid dresses. My ideal look would be a pretty...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"heather_d26@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.254.20.26","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1471715549,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287595.jpg?_r=1471732058","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"heatherd26","Id":287595,"Name":"heatherd26","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.254.20.26","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80280,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2ca71c4f81b9075bdb76d3d7d57ea25c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Everyone!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am really struggling to find bridesmaid dresses. My ideal look would be a pretty coral dress, likely sleeveless or small straps, knee length or just above the knee, likely light and flowy. I am open to other colours but it must be a brighter colour. I love how the brighter colours pop on the beach. I don&#039;t want my girls spending a ton, hence why I&#039;m likely having a hard time finding anything.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Any ideas or suggestions would be greatly appreciated! Thanks so much! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915494,"PostDate":1472492166,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Everyone!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am really struggling to find bridesmaid dresses. My ideal look would be a pretty coral dress, likely sleeveless or small straps, knee length or just above the knee, likely light and flowy. I am open to other colours but it must be a brighter colour. I love how the brighter colours pop on the beach. I don't want my girls spending a ton, hence why I'm likely having a hard time finding anything.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Any ideas or suggestions would be greatly appreciated! Thanks so much! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"heather_d26@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.254.20.26","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1471715549,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287595.jpg?_r=1471732058","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"heatherd26","Id":287595,"Name":"heatherd26","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.67.9.47","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80280,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a7aea95cc9f6e0df6df026b0113145ec","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Well obviously David&#039;s Bridal for bridesmaids dresses is a popular option, but it can get pricey.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Have you considered a convertible dress, so that each bridesmaid can wear the same color but style it in a way that is most comfortable for their own body type, etc?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My sister in-law used this Etsy shop for her bridesmaids dresses and they were beautiful and super affordable! Plus you can order the color you want :) And yes, they do have a beautiful coral color that would look amazing on the beach.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here&#039;s the link to her shop on Etsy:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/shop\/thedaintyard?ref=pr_faveshops&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/shop\/thedaintyard?ref=pr_faveshops&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope that helps!!!&amp;nbsp; ;)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915495,"PostDate":1472493713,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Well obviously David's Bridal for bridesmaids dresses is a popular option, but it can get pricey.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Have you considered a convertible dress, so that each bridesmaid can wear the same color but style it in a way that is most comfortable for their own body type, etc?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My sister in-law used this Etsy shop for her bridesmaids dresses and they were beautiful and super affordable! Plus you can order the color you want <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> And yes, they do have a beautiful coral color that would look amazing on the beach.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here's the link to her shop on Etsy:\u00a0<a href='https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/shop\/thedaintyard?ref=pr_faveshops' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.etsy.com...ef=pr_faveshops<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope that helps!!!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia;\"><strong>MARIESAM SANCHEZ PHOTOGRAPHY<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br>\nWEBSITE: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchez.com\">www.mariesamsanchez.com<\/a><br>\nBLOG: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchezblog.com\">www.mariesamsanchez.com<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchez.com\/blog'>\/blog<\/a><br>\nCONTACT ME: <a  class=\"bbc_email\" href=\"mailto:mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com?subject=BDW%20Inquiry\" title=\"E-mail Link\">mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com<\/a><br><br><img src=\"http:\/\/i287.photobucket.com\/albums\/ll150\/msam007562\/063cb5c8-dbda-4822-87fe-ba3c0ebcdb7f.jpg\" alt=\"063cb5c8-dbda-4822-87fe-ba3c0ebcdb7f.jpg\">","Email":"mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.100.61.37","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1285939945,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232833.jpg?_r=1422091823","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":220,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MarieSamSanchezPhoto","Id":232833,"Name":"MarieSamSanchezPhoto","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.231.185.152","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80280,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"30811531dd702b75d17f29a445464099","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;The link that @[member=\"MarieSamSanchezPhoto\"] is great. &amp;nbsp;I didn&#039;t end up buying from them but the customer service was great and I got a sample of 6 colours to see how the fabric was like. &amp;nbsp;The seller can do a customization so that each bridesmaid can pay for their own. I think the price for each dress is about $70 and shipping is from Singapore so about $30CAD. &amp;nbsp;I don&#039;t know the cost for shipping in bulk.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915506,"PostDate":1472546875,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>The link that @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"232833\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/232833-mariesamsanchezphoto\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">MarieSamSanchezPhoto<\/span><\/a> is great. \u00a0I didn't end up buying from them but the customer service was great and I got a sample of 6 colours to see how the fabric was like. \u00a0The seller can do a customization so that each bridesmaid can pay for their own. I think the price for each dress is about $70 and shipping is from Singapore so about $30CAD. \u00a0I don't know the cost for shipping in bulk.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"falleneight@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.26.14.237","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1441716631,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284728.jpg?_r=1448387511","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"OttawaBride2017","Id":284728,"Name":"OttawaBride2017","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"80280","Title":"Bridesmaid Dresses - Help!","LastPostDate":1472546875},"Pages":{"TotalItems":3,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
